{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1380464-flesh-sculpting-art","id":1380464,"title":"Flesh Sculpting Art","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-04-11T13:27:25-07:00","id":1380464,"title":"Flesh Sculpting Art","content":"Hello, could someone explain to me how does Flesh-Sculpting Art's reduction of surgery time translate into game mechanics? I haven't found any rules about the length of surgery procedures.<br /> Would the reduction apply to healing times instead?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>When will you rage?","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1405-anteros","name":"Anteros","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1405_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"661"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-11T14:13:05-07:00","id":1380479,"title":"","content":"I just wanted to note, it's easier to answer these sorts of questions if you can provide an indication of where the source of the material you're asking about is. There's a <i>lot</i> of charms in Exalted, and memorizing them all is difficult. You'll probably get quicker help if people don't have to search through four or more books' worth of pdfs to figure out what you're asking about. All that said...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Anteros</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1380464-flesh-sculpting-art#post1380464\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hello, could someone explain to me how does Flesh-Sculpting Art's reduction of surgery time translate into game mechanics? I haven't found any rules about the length of surgery procedures.</div> </div> </div> </div>There are no precise surgery times given, but the mechanics of Flesh-Sculpting Art are pretty clear, I'd say - they let you do surgeries that would take hours in minutes. So if the ST decides that the operation you're doing to re-break and re-set someone's badly healed broken leg would normally take an hour, you can instead perform that in a minute. The system assumes that the ST will assign reasonable times to various tasks.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Anteros</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Would the reduction apply to healing times instead?</div> </div> </div> </div>No, the charm doesn't say it reduces healing times, so it doesn't. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Interested in chatting with other Exalted fans online? Join us on the <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kGsyF5jhdy\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted Discord server</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1533-kelly-pedersen","name":"Kelly Pedersen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1533_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"929"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-11T15:57:09-07:00","id":1380509,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Anteros</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1380464-flesh-sculpting-art#post1380464\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hello, could someone explain to me how does Flesh-Sculpting Art's reduction of surgery time translate into game mechanics? I haven't found any rules about the length of surgery procedures.<br /> Would the reduction apply to healing times instead?</div> </div> </div> </div>As a <i>really</i> rough ballpark:<br /> <br /> Surgery on a single body part takes an hour.<br /> Surgery on multiple body parts takes that many hours.<br /> Spinal surgery takes six hours.<br /> <br /> Surgery isn't quick. If you're having proper anaesthetic and cleaning and dressing wounds as you should be, then throw another hour on these times.<br /> <br /> I'm not saying you can't trepan a guy or amputate a limb in less time. It's the STs call.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-12T07:27:46-07:00","id":1380651,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1380464-flesh-sculpting-art?p=1380509#post1380509\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As a <i>really</i> rough ballpark:<br /> <br /> Surgery on a single body part takes an hour.<br /> Surgery on multiple body parts takes that many hours.<br /> Spinal surgery takes six hours.<br /> <br /> Surgery isn't quick. If you're having proper anaesthetic and cleaning and dressing wounds as you should be, then throw another hour on these times.<br /> <br /> I'm not saying you can't trepan a guy or amputate a limb in less time. It's the STs call.</div> </div> </div> </div>Then there's the Solar way, to karate chop the tumor out of somebody's noggin.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12357-marcob","name":"Marcob","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12357_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}